            <div class="content-grid">
                <div class="content-block">
                    <h3>Definition of mTBI</h3>
                    <p>A mild traumatic brain injury (concussion) is caused by a bump, blow, or jolt to the head that disrupts normal brain function.</p>
                    <div class="highlight-box">
                        <p><strong>Diagnosis:</strong> Post-concussion syndrome with cognitive impairment</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="content-block">
                    <h3>Symptoms Experienced</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Persistent daily headaches and migraines</li>
                        <li>Vertigo and balance issues</li>
                        <li>Sensitivity to light and sound</li>
                        <li>Cognitive fatigue and memory deficits</li>
                        <li>Personality changes and irritability</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bar"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Slide 5 -->
