                        <span class="label">Hospitalizations</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="number">18</span>
                        <span class="label">Months of Therapy</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="number">Ongoing</span>
                        <span class="label">Medical Care</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                    <li>Emergency room evaluation immediately following incident</li>
                    <li>Neurological evaluations and MRI imaging</li>
                    <li>Vestibular rehabilitation therapy for balance</li>
                    <li>Cognitive behavioral therapy for memory and focus</li>
                    <li>Medication management for chronic pain and headaches</li>
                </ul>
