        <div class="slide-body">
            <div class="content-grid">
                <div class="content-block">
                    <h3>Professional Impact</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Unable to return to warehouse management role</li>
                        <li>Significant reduction in cognitive capacity for complex tasks</li>
                        <li>Lost promotion opportunity due to extended absence</li>
                        <li>Currently working reduced hours in administrative capacity</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
