                    <li><strong>Mark Johnson, Biomechanical Engineer:</strong> Will testify about the door's design defect and the physics of the impact.</li>
                    <li><strong>Dr. Robert Vance, Neuropsychologist:</strong> Will present cognitive testing results demonstrating functional impairment.</li>
                    <li><strong>Emily White, Vocational Expert:</strong> Will testify regarding loss of earning capacity and future medical needs.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bar"></div>
