                    <h4 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Medical Records Show:</h4>
                    <ul style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                        <li>No prior history of concussions or head trauma</li>
                        <li>No neurological disorders or chronic headaches</li>
                        <li>Annual physical exams consistently cleared for full duty work</li>
                        <li>Active lifestyle with regular cardiovascular exercise</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
