            <div class="slide-number">Slide 17</div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide-body">
            <div class="content-block">
                <h3>Pre-Trial Mediation</h3>
                <p>Multiple attempts to resolve this matter prior to trial were unsuccessful due to the defendant's unwillingness to acknowledge the design defect.</p>
                <div class="highlight-box">
                    <h4 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Negotiation Timeline</h4>
