            <div class="content-block">
                <h3>Jury Responsibilities</h3>
                <p>The jury serves as the trier of fact in this case. Your role is to:</p>
                <ul style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                    <li>Evaluate the credibility of all witnesses</li>
                    <li>Weigh the evidence presented by both sides</li>
                    <li>Apply the law as instructed by the judge</li>
                    <li>Determine if the plaintiff has met the burden of proof</li>
                    <li>Decide on the appropriate amount of damages, if any</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="highlight-box">
                    <p><strong>Standard:</strong> Decisions must be based solely on evidence presented in court, not outside information or bias.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bar"></div>
    </div>

